 707+ 8797              ; Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore
 708+ 8797              ; Se player_score > high_score, copia player_score in high_score.
 709+ 8797              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------
 710+ 8797              Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore:
 711+ 8797                  ; Confronto BCD a 3 byte (big-endian: byte 2 -> byte 1 -> byte 0)
 712+ 8797                  ; Byte 2:
 713+ 8797 3A 9A F0         ld   a, (player_score + 2)
